From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:36:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner A733 PCIe controller

The Allwinner A733 has a DesignWare PCIe controller whose lane runs
through the second combo PHY of the SERDES block. Enable the controller
driver, which can only be built in, and the PHY driver as a module.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on one board; the kernel built with this
option bound the host driver, and the NVMe drive enumerated and was read.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 3f73dc0ed104..4ea04aba246f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -247,6 +247,7 @@ CONFIG_PCIE_QCOM=y
 CONFIG_PCIE_RCAR_GEN4_HOST=m
 CONFIG_PCIE_RCAR_GEN4_EP=m
 CONFIG_PCIE_ROCKCHIP_DW_HOST=y
+CONFIG_PCIE_SUN60I_A733=y
 CONFIG_PCIE_VISCONTI_HOST=y
 CONFIG_PCIE_LAYERSCAPE_GEN4=y
 CONFIG_PCI_ENDPOINT=y
@@ -1765,6 +1766,7 @@ CONFIG_PHY_XGENE=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN4I_USB=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_USB2=m
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_COMBO=m
+CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_PCIE_COMBO=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_TORRENT=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY_RX=m
